{
 "total": 658.689,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Multan.",
   "start": 1.65,
   "end": 2.93,
   "idx": 0
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "September 1949.",
   "start": 3.63,
   "end": 6.43,
   "idx": 1
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "A prison cell.",
   "start": 8.03,
   "end": 9.397,
   "idx": 2
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "One small lamp.",
   "start": 10.097,
   "end": 11.777,
   "idx": 3
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "And a man bent over a page.",
   "start": 12.477,
   "end": 15.077,
   "idx": 4
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "His name is Sayyid Abul A'la Mawdudi, rahimahullah.",
   "start": 16.677,
   "end": 20.677,
   "idx": 5
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "He is writing the preface to a book he began seven years earlier.",
   "start": 21.377,
   "end": 25.217,
   "idx": 6
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "A book that would travel far beyond that cell.",
   "start": 25.917,
   "end": 29.037,
   "idx": 7
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Tafhim al-Qur'an.",
   "start": 30.637,
   "end": 32.557,
   "idx": 8
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Making the Qur'an understood.",
   "start": 33.257,
   "end": 35.657,
   "idx": 9
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Before the book, he wrote a short preface.",
   "start": 37.257,
   "end": 39.977,
   "idx": 10
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Only nine pages.",
   "start": 40.677,
   "end": 41.837,
   "idx": 11
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Most people skip it.",
   "start": 42.537,
   "end": 43.737,
   "idx": 12
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "But in those nine pages, he tells you how to meet the Book of Allah.",
   "start": 44.437,
   "end": 48.917,
   "idx": 13
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 1,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "So let's not skip it.",
   "start": 49.617,
   "end": 51.417,
   "idx": 14
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "He begins with an honest question.",
   "start": 54.217,
   "end": 56.417,
   "idx": 15
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Shelves were already full of translations and tafsir.",
   "start": 57.117,
   "end": 60.237,
   "idx": 16
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "So why add one more?",
   "start": 60.937,
   "end": 62.577,
   "idx": 17
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Writing another one just for the blessing of it, he says, is not a good use of time anymore.",
   "start": 64.177,
   "end": 69.337,
   "idx": 18
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "It is only worth it if it fills a gap.",
   "start": 70.037,
   "end": 72.637,
   "idx": 19
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 2,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "A need that the earlier works left unmet.",
   "start": 73.337,
   "end": 76.226,
   "idx": 20
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And he had seen that need for years.",
   "start": 79.026,
   "end": 81.475,
   "idx": 21
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Ordinary, educated Muslims wanted to reach the spirit of the Qur'an.",
   "start": 82.175,
   "end": 86.548,
   "idx": 22
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "They wanted to know what this Book is really asking of them.",
   "start": 87.248,
   "end": 90.431,
   "idx": 23
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "The translators had done valuable work.",
   "start": 92.031,
   "end": 94.391,
   "idx": 24
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "And still, he writes, that longing stayed thirsty.",
   "start": 95.091,
   "end": 98.619,
   "idx": 25
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "He felt he could help quench that thirst.",
   "start": 100.219,
   "end": 102.739,
   "idx": 26
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "And those two feelings, the thirst he saw and the help he could give, became this book.",
   "start": 103.439,
   "end": 108.959,
   "idx": 27
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "So who is it for?",
   "start": 110.559,
   "end": 111.892,
   "idx": 28
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Not the scholars.",
   "start": 112.592,
   "end": 113.632,
   "idx": 29
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "They already have plenty.",
   "start": 114.332,
   "end": 115.652,
   "idx": 30
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "It is for people like you and me.",
   "start": 116.352,
   "end": 118.512,
   "idx": 31
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "People who did not study Arabic.",
   "start": 119.212,
   "end": 121.092,
   "idx": 32
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "So he left out the debates that only specialists need.",
   "start": 121.792,
   "end": 124.837,
   "idx": 33
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "His aim was simple.",
   "start": 126.437,
   "end": 128.077,
   "idx": 34
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "That you understand what Allah is saying, clearly.",
   "start": 128.777,
   "end": 132.164,
   "idx": 35
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "And that you feel what the Qur'an wants you to feel.",
   "start": 132.864,
   "end": 135.571,
   "idx": 36
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 11,
   "text": "Where a doubt comes up, he answers it right there.",
   "start": 136.271,
   "end": 139.162,
   "idx": 37
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 12,
   "text": "And then, with real humility, he asks his readers and the scholars: show me where I fell short.",
   "start": 140.762,
   "end": 146.802,
   "idx": 38
  },
  {
   "part": 1,
   "sec": 3,
   "para": 12,
   "text": "This is not the last word.",
   "start": 147.502,
   "end": 149.102,
   "idx": 39
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Then comes the heart of the preface.",
   "start": 151.902,
   "end": 154.542,
   "idx": 40
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "How do you carry the Qur'an into another language?",
   "start": 155.242,
   "end": 158.522,
   "idx": 41
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "He chose a free rendering.",
   "start": 160.122,
   "end": 162.282,
   "idx": 42
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "He calls it tarjumani.",
   "start": 162.982,
   "end": 164.902,
   "idx": 43
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Not because word-for-word translation is wrong.",
   "start": 165.602,
   "end": 168.242,
   "idx": 44
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Great scholars had done it beautifully: Shah Waliullah in Persian, and in Urdu Shah Abdul Qadir, Shah Rafiuddin, Mawlana Mahmud al-Hasan, Mawlana Ashraf Ali Thanawi, and Hafiz Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari.",
   "start": 168.942,
   "end": 181.862,
   "idx": 45
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Word for word teaches you what every word means.",
   "start": 182.562,
   "end": 185.789,
   "idx": 46
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "That is a real gift.",
   "start": 186.488,
   "end": 188.355,
   "idx": 47
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "But for someone who doesn't know Arabic, he says, it has weaknesses.",
   "start": 189.955,
   "end": 194.473,
   "idx": 48
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 4,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And the first one is life.",
   "start": 195.173,
   "end": 198.0,
   "idx": 49
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "You read a literal translation, and the words just lie there.",
   "start": 200.8,
   "end": 205.45,
   "idx": 50
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Your heart is not moved.",
   "start": 207.05,
   "end": 208.863,
   "idx": 51
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "The hair on your skin does not rise.",
   "start": 209.563,
   "end": 212.016,
   "idx": 52
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "No tears come.",
   "start": 212.716,
   "end": 213.996,
   "idx": 53
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Nothing stirs inside you.",
   "start": 214.696,
   "end": 216.779,
   "idx": 54
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And a terrible thought creeps in.",
   "start": 218.379,
   "end": 220.752,
   "idx": 55
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Is this really the Book that challenged the whole world?",
   "start": 221.452,
   "end": 225.265,
   "idx": 56
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "He says a literal translation is like a sieve.",
   "start": 226.865,
   "end": 229.886,
   "idx": 57
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "The dry ingredients of the medicine pass through.",
   "start": 230.586,
   "end": 233.146,
   "idx": 58
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "But the living spirit of the language flies away, above it.",
   "start": 233.846,
   "end": 237.878,
   "idx": 59
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And the Qur'an's power was in its language as much as in its teaching.",
   "start": 239.478,
   "end": 243.723,
   "idx": 60
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "That is what melted hearts of stone.",
   "start": 244.423,
   "end": 246.743,
   "idx": 61
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "That is what struck Arabia like lightning.",
   "start": 247.443,
   "end": 249.963,
   "idx": 62
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Its fiercest enemies were afraid that whoever listened to it would lose his heart to it.",
   "start": 250.663,
   "end": 255.787,
   "idx": 63
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 5,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "Had it come in the language of its translations, he says, it could never have done that.",
   "start": 257.387,
   "end": 263.067,
   "idx": 64
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "The second weakness is flow.",
   "start": 265.867,
   "end": 267.987,
   "idx": 65
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Translations sit between the lines, or on half a page.",
   "start": 268.687,
   "end": 272.247,
   "idx": 66
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Fine for study.",
   "start": 272.947,
   "end": 274.014,
   "idx": 67
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "But you cannot read them straight through, like a book.",
   "start": 274.714,
   "end": 277.661,
   "idx": 68
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "English is even worse.",
   "start": 278.361,
   "end": 279.761,
   "idx": 69
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 9,
   "text": "Every verse cut out and numbered.",
   "start": 280.461,
   "end": 282.946,
   "idx": 70
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Take any beautiful piece of writing, he says, and number its sentences.",
   "start": 284.546,
   "end": 289.106,
   "idx": 71
  },
  {
   "part": 2,
   "sec": 6,
   "para": 10,
   "text": "Half of its effect is gone.",
   "start": 289.806,
   "end": 291.646,
   "idx": 72
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "And then a point he calls very important.",
   "start": 294.37,
   "end": 297.977,
   "idx": 73
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "The Qur'an is speech.",
   "start": 298.677,
   "end": 300.757,
   "idx": 74
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Not writing.",
   "start": 301.457,
   "end": 302.137,
   "idx": 75
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "It did not come down as a printed book.",
   "start": 303.737,
   "end": 306.457,
   "idx": 76
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "As the call to Islam moved forward, Allah sent down an address for each moment, and the Prophet, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, delivered it to people like a khutbah.",
   "start": 307.157,
   "end": 316.997,
   "idx": 77
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And speech works differently.",
   "start": 318.597,
   "end": 320.452,
   "idx": 78
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "On paper, you first write the objection, then the answer.",
   "start": 321.152,
   "end": 324.832,
   "idx": 79
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In a speech, the objectors are standing right there.",
   "start": 325.532,
   "end": 328.452,
   "idx": 80
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "So the answer simply comes.",
   "start": 329.152,
   "end": 331.072,
   "idx": 81
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "On paper, you must describe the setting.",
   "start": 331.772,
   "end": 334.292,
   "idx": 82
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In a speech, the setting is all around.",
   "start": 334.992,
   "end": 337.992,
   "idx": 83
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And in a speech, the voice turns.",
   "start": 339.592,
   "end": 342.472,
   "idx": 84
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "People are spoken about, then spoken to.",
   "start": 343.172,
   "end": 346.372,
   "idx": 85
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "One person, then many.",
   "start": 347.072,
   "end": 348.872,
   "idx": 86
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Sometimes the speaker speaks for himself, sometimes for a group, sometimes on behalf of Allah.",
   "start": 349.572,
   "end": 355.332,
   "idx": 87
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And sometimes, Allah Himself speaks.",
   "start": 356.032,
   "end": 359.272,
   "idx": 88
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Heard aloud, this is beauty.",
   "start": 360.872,
   "end": 363.512,
   "idx": 89
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "On paper, it can feel disconnected.",
   "start": 364.212,
   "end": 366.745,
   "idx": 90
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "In Arabic, not one letter may be changed, so only notes can help.",
   "start": 367.445,
   "end": 371.858,
   "idx": 91
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "But in another language, if the speech is carefully turned into written style, the gap closes.",
   "start": 372.558,
   "end": 378.718,
   "idx": 92
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Every surah came for a moment.",
   "start": 381.518,
   "end": 383.958,
   "idx": 93
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "It had a background, and a need it came to meet.",
   "start": 384.658,
   "end": 387.618,
   "idx": 94
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Strip that away, and some things are not understood at all.",
   "start": 388.318,
   "end": 391.558,
   "idx": 95
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Some are understood upside down.",
   "start": 392.258,
   "end": 394.458,
   "idx": 96
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "So a rendering should carry some of that background with it.",
   "start": 395.158,
   "end": 398.762,
   "idx": 97
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "And the Qur'an has its own vocabulary.",
   "start": 401.562,
   "end": 404.322,
   "idx": 98
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "A language within the language.",
   "start": 405.022,
   "end": 407.426,
   "idx": 99
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Take one word.",
   "start": 409.026,
   "end": 410.386,
   "idx": 100
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Kufr.",
   "start": 411.086,
   "end": 411.926,
   "idx": 101
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In one place it means complete disbelief.",
   "start": 412.626,
   "end": 415.306,
   "idx": 102
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, simple denial.",
   "start": 416.006,
   "end": 417.886,
   "idx": 103
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, only ingratitude.",
   "start": 418.586,
   "end": 420.853,
   "idx": 104
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, falling short in something faith requires.",
   "start": 421.553,
   "end": 425.047,
   "idx": 105
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "In another, believing in principle, but refusing in practice.",
   "start": 425.747,
   "end": 429.481,
   "idx": 106
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And in another, obeying on the outside, while disbelieving inside.",
   "start": 430.181,
   "end": 434.693,
   "idx": 107
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "Translate it as kufr everywhere, and you are technically correct.",
   "start": 436.293,
   "end": 440.24,
   "idx": 108
  },
  {
   "part": 3,
   "sec": 9,
   "para": 8,
   "text": "But the reader will miss it here, misread it there, and get lost somewhere else.",
   "start": 440.94,
   "end": 445.287,
   "idx": 109
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "So here is what he did.",
   "start": 448.087,
   "end": 450.487,
   "idx": 110
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He did not dress the Qur'an's words in Urdu clothes.",
   "start": 451.187,
   "end": 454.947,
   "idx": 111
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He read a passage.",
   "start": 455.647,
   "end": 457.06,
   "idx": 112
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He took the meaning he understood, and the effect it left on his own heart.",
   "start": 457.76,
   "end": 462.346,
   "idx": 113
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "And he carried that, as faithfully as he could, into his own language.",
   "start": 463.046,
   "end": 467.819,
   "idx": 114
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Clear Arabic should become clear Urdu.",
   "start": 469.419,
   "end": 472.579,
   "idx": 115
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "The flow of speech should come through.",
   "start": 473.279,
   "end": 475.799,
   "idx": 116
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "And the majesty of Allah's words should shine, as far as possible.",
   "start": 476.499,
   "end": 481.699,
   "idx": 117
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "That needed freedom.",
   "start": 483.299,
   "end": 485.259,
   "idx": 118
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "But this was the Word of Allah.",
   "start": 485.959,
   "end": 488.559,
   "idx": 119
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "So he writes: I used this freedom… while very much afraid.",
   "start": 490.159,
   "end": 495.302,
   "idx": 120
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 10,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "And he never stepped beyond what the Qur'an's own words allow.",
   "start": 496.902,
   "end": 501.342,
   "idx": 121
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "What a rendering cannot carry, he gave you in two more ways.",
   "start": 504.142,
   "end": 508.275,
   "idx": 122
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Before every surah, an introduction: when it came down, what was happening, where the call to Islam stood, and what it was facing.",
   "start": 508.975,
   "end": 516.748,
   "idx": 123
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And notes, but only in two kinds of places.",
   "start": 517.448,
   "end": 520.461,
   "idx": 124
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Where a question would rise in your mind.",
   "start": 521.161,
   "end": 523.254,
   "idx": 125
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And where you might hurry past, and miss the real spirit of a verse.",
   "start": 523.954,
   "end": 527.954,
   "idx": 126
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 11,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Nothing that pulls your eyes away from the Qur'an.",
   "start": 528.654,
   "end": 531.854,
   "idx": 127
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "And then he gives you a way to read.",
   "start": 534.654,
   "end": 537.152,
   "idx": 128
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "One.",
   "start": 537.852,
   "end": 538.572,
   "idx": 129
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read the surah's introduction, and come back to it as you go.",
   "start": 539.272,
   "end": 542.832,
   "idx": 130
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Two.",
   "start": 543.532,
   "end": 544.092,
   "idx": 131
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Take your daily portion, and first go through it word for word, verse by verse, in whatever language you like.",
   "start": 544.792,
   "end": 551.152,
   "idx": 132
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Three.",
   "start": 551.852,
   "end": 552.292,
   "idx": 133
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read his rendering of that portion straight through, without the notes, so the whole message stands before you at once.",
   "start": 552.992,
   "end": 559.552,
   "idx": 134
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Four.",
   "start": 560.252,
   "end": 560.932,
   "idx": 135
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Go back, verse by verse, with the notes.",
   "start": 561.632,
   "end": 565.072,
   "idx": 136
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Read like this, he says, and an ordinary reader will come to know the Qur'an well.",
   "start": 566.672,
   "end": 571.752,
   "idx": 137
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Maybe not like a scholar.",
   "start": 572.452,
   "end": 573.972,
   "idx": 138
  },
  {
   "part": 4,
   "sec": 12,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "But well, in sha' Allah.",
   "start": 574.672,
   "end": 576.032,
   "idx": 139
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "He began in February 1942.",
   "start": 578.762,
   "end": 582.362,
   "idx": 140
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "For more than five years he wrote, until he reached the end of Surah Yusuf.",
   "start": 583.062,
   "end": 587.942,
   "idx": 141
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Then life left him no time to write, or even to revise.",
   "start": 588.642,
   "end": 592.482,
   "idx": 142
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Call it good luck or bad luck, he writes.",
   "start": 594.082,
   "end": 597.682,
   "idx": 143
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "In October 1948, he was suddenly arrested and taken to jail.",
   "start": 599.282,
   "end": 604.15,
   "idx": 144
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 2,
   "text": "And there, behind the bars, he found the time the book needed.",
   "start": 604.85,
   "end": 609.143,
   "idx": 145
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "He ends with a dua: that this work truly helps the servants of Allah understand the Qur'an.",
   "start": 610.743,
   "end": 617.036,
   "idx": 146
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And one line in Arabic.",
   "start": 617.736,
   "end": 619.389,
   "idx": 147
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Wa ma tawfiqi illa billah.",
   "start": 620.989,
   "end": 623.789,
   "idx": 148
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 13,
   "para": 4,
   "text": "My success is only through Allah.",
   "start": 624.489,
   "end": 627.449,
   "idx": 149
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "A prison cell.",
   "start": 630.249,
   "end": 631.609,
   "idx": 150
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "One small lamp.",
   "start": 632.309,
   "end": 633.909,
   "idx": 151
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And a book that travelled far beyond it.",
   "start": 634.609,
   "end": 637.489,
   "idx": 152
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Now it is in your hands.",
   "start": 639.089,
   "end": 641.009,
   "idx": 153
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Read the setting.",
   "start": 641.709,
   "end": 642.709,
   "idx": 154
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Learn the words.",
   "start": 643.409,
   "end": 644.569,
   "idx": 155
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Hear it whole.",
   "start": 645.269,
   "end": 646.549,
   "idx": 156
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Then go deep.",
   "start": 647.249,
   "end": 648.929,
   "idx": 157
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Open Tafhim al-Qur'an.",
   "start": 650.529,
   "end": 652.529,
   "idx": 158
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "Start with one surah.",
   "start": 653.229,
   "end": 654.629,
   "idx": 159
  },
  {
   "part": 5,
   "sec": 14,
   "para": 7,
   "text": "And let it reach your heart.",
   "start": 655.329,
   "end": 656.769,
   "idx": 160
  }
 ]
}